---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Early Stopping Rollout: One Line That Fixes On-Policy Distillation | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="On-policy distillation breaks when long student rollouts poison the teacher signal. ESR fixes it with a single line: stop the rollout at N=100 tokens."
  crumb="ESR"
>

