</table>

<p>Interestingly, ESR students also generate 2–3× shorter responses than their teacher: median ~380 tokens vs ~1,150 for the teacher. By removing late-position supervision, the student preserves its own concise style while inheriting the teacher's strategic reasoning.</p>
</section>

<!-- ─── §06 RESULTS ─── -->
